olute [&amp;_#piano-container:not(:empty)]:before:-top-40 [&amp;_#piano-container:not(:empty)]:before:w-full [&amp;_#piano-container:not(:empty)]:before:bg-gradient-to-b [&amp;_#piano-container:not(:empty)]:before:from-transparent [&amp;_#piano-container:not(:empty)]:before:to-white [&amp;_#piano-container:not(:empty)]:before:pointer-events-none [&amp;_#piano-spinner]:relative [&amp;_#piano-spinner]:before:content-[&quot;&quot;] [&amp;_#piano-spinner]:before:h-40 [&amp;_#piano-spinner]:before:absolute [&amp;_#piano-spinner]:before:-top-40 [&amp;_#piano-spinner]:before:w-full [&amp;_#piano-spinner]:before:bg-gradient-to-b [&amp;_#piano-spinner]:before:from-transparent [&amp;_#piano-spinner]:before:to-white [&amp;_#piano-spinner]:before:pointer-events-none [&amp;_#paywall-fallback-container]:relative [&amp;_#paywall-fallback-container]:before:content-[&quot;&quot;] [&amp;_#paywall-fallback-container]:before:h-40 [&amp;_#paywall-fallback-container]:before:absolute [&amp;_#paywall-fallback-container]:before:-top-40 [&amp;_#paywall-fallback-container]:before:w-full [&amp;_#paywall-fallback-container]:before:bg-gradient-to-b [&amp;_#paywall-fallback-container]:before:from-transparent [&amp;_#paywall-fallback-container]:before:to-white [&amp;_#paywall-fallback-container]:before:pointer-events-none [&amp;_figure&gt;figcaption&gt;span]:font-sans" data-chromatic="ignore"><span data-schema="smart-brevity"><p>Kristin Wilson, one of Metro government&#x27;s most consequential officials, is leaving Mayor Freddie O&#x27;Connell&#x27;s office.</p><p><strong>Why it matters: </strong>Wilson serves as the city&#x27;s chief of operations and performance, a behind-the-scenes role that is out of the public eye but at the center of the most pressing Metro issues.</p></span><div className="absolute z-10" id="piano-recaptcha"></div><div id="piano-wall"></div><span data-cy="story-go-deeper-content" data-nosnippet class="gated-content"><p><strong>Zoom in: </strong>Wilson worked with Metro for seven years, navigating the pandemic, the 2020 tornado, the Christmas bombing and school shootings.</p><ul><li>Her job is to make sure the city government operates efficiently. She served as one of the top aides to both O&#x27;Connell and his predecessor, Mayor John Cooper.</li></ul><p><strong>Zoom out: </strong>Wilson is the fourth top aide to leave the mayor&#x27;s office since July 2025. Other departures include former chief of staff <a class="gtmContentClick" data-vars-link-text="Marjorie Pomeroy-Wallace" data-vars-click-url="https://www.axios.com/local/nashville/2025/07/08/mayor-oconnell-new-chief-of-staff-marjorie-pomeroy-wallace-moves-to-new-role" data-vars-content-id="dd404bc5-fcbc-48f2-ba93-fce79e538607" data-vars-headline="Mayoral aide Kristin Wilson resigns from top Metro post" data-vars-event-category="story" data-vars-sub-category="story" data-vars-item="in_content_link" href="https://www.axios.com/local/nashville/2025/07/08/mayor-oconnell-new-chief-of-staff-marjorie-pomeroy-wallace-moves-to-new-role" target="_self">Marjorie Pomeroy-Wallace</a>, development chief <a class="gtmContentClick" data-vars-link-text="Bob Mendes" data-vars-click-url="https://www.axios.com/local/nashville/2025/09/24/top-oconnell-aide-bob-mendes-to-leave-the-mayors-office" data-vars-content-id="dd404bc5-fcbc-48f2-ba93-fce79e538607" data-vars-headline="Mayoral aide Kristin Wilson resigns from top Metro post" data-vars-event-category="story" data-vars-sub-category="story" data-vars-item="in_content_link" href="https://www.axios.com/local/nashville/2025/09/24/top-oconnell-aide-bob-mendes-to-leave-the-mayors-office" target="_self">Bob Mendes</a> and legal director <a class="gtmContentClick" data-vars-link-text="Wally Dietz" data-vars-click-url="https://www.bizjournals.com/nashville/news/2026/07/28/wally-dietz-metro-nashville-tennessee-exit-retire.html" data-vars-content-id="dd404bc5-fcbc-48f2-ba93-fce79e538607" data-vars-headline="Mayoral aide Kristin Wilson resigns from top Metro post" data-vars-event-category="story" data-vars-sub-category="story" data-vars-item="in_content_link" href="https://www.bizjournals.com/nashville/news/2026/07/28/wally-dietz-metro-nashville-tennessee-exit-retire.html" target="_blank">Wally Dietz</a>.</p><p><strong>What they&#x27;re saying: </strong>Wilson said in her resignation letter Tuesday she believes Metro is &quot;in a better operational place than it was when I started.&quot;</p><ul><li>O&#x27;Connell lauded Wilson in a statement for &quot;overseeing the city&#x27;s response to some of our most profound tragedies and crises while also guiding us through a considerable era of growth in our city that impacted operations.&quot;</li></ul><span data-ad-status="NO_AD_LENGTH" data-ad-type="midStoryAd"></span></span></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 mb-6 sm:mb-10 md:flex-row"><div data-vars-event-name="share_view" data-vars-content-id="dd404bc5-fcbc-48f2-ba93-fce79e538607" data-vars-headline="Mayoral aide Kristin Wilson resigns from top Metro post" data-vars-location="bottom" data-vars-latitude="36.18" data-vars-longitude="-86.74" data-vars-postal-code="37206" class="gtmView"><ul data-cy="social-share-bottom" class="flex items-center gap-3 leading-0 py-0.5"><li class="flex items-center rounded-full border border-primary p-[3px] gap-1"><button type="button" role="link" data-cy="email-share" aria-label="Share Mayoral aide Kristin Wilson resigns from top Metro post on Email" class="border border-solid px-4 py-2 rounded-md appearance-none cursor-pointer font-sans leading-tight duration-200 inline-flex items-center justify-center [&amp;&gt;.icon+span]:ml-2 [&amp;&gt;span+.icon]:ml-2 disabled:bg-white disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:border-accent-blue-tint disabled:text-soft-black-medium !p-0 p-0 m-0 text-current border-0 border-none bg-none hover:underline focus:underline focus:outline-accent-blue-core focus:outline-offset-2 disabled:text-soft-black-medium disabled:no-underline disabled:cursor-not-all